From 7e6a5887e17d7fbdcadba6abe097cd4872ba4549 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Sebasti=C3=A3o=20Guerra?= <sebastiao.luiz.guerra@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 09:50:06 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] TDECORE: improve SVG image handling
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add support for rendering SVG data directly from memory.

Harden SVG parsing for malformed input and prevent in-memory SVG data from loading external image resources.

Add automated coverage for the SVG engine.

Signed-off-by: Sebastião Guerra <sebastiao.luiz.guerra@gmail.com>
